      "ArticleTitle": "Is substance P a primary afferent neurotransmitter for nociceptive input? IV. 2-Amino-5-phosphonovalerate (APV) and [D-Pro2,D-Trp7,9]-substance P exert different effects on behaviors induced by intrathecal substance P, strychnine and kainic acid.",
